Z||000000||AnimalGT||12-31-2001||02:23 AM||||Has anyone tried to overhaul their power mirrors?  My pass side mirror is considerably slower than my drivers side, and very annoying.  I want to fix this, but I haven't taken mirrors apart before, and I was wondering if the mirrors can be overhauled or not.<BR>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000001||avengador1||12-31-2001||08:26 AM||||I took my drivers mirror apart to relube it. It is a very delicate operation and could break the gears if not done carefully. It took long thin screwdrivers to pop it apart and luck to put it back together. Good luck if you intend to do this. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
